Playing the Trempealeau Hotel on **7/25/26**, Winona Is Dead presents this *Fire On
The Water* show poster — designed, numbered, and signed by Winona's own Isaac Sammis.
Saucy Fields is screen-printing a limited number of these for the show.

- **Dimensions:** 18 × 24 inches
- Grab one here to guarantee yours and save a couple bucks in the process.
- Pick up at the show, or if you're in the greater Winona area we can drop it off.
- Want one shipped from Winona? Choose shipping at checkout.
